  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside the eighth layer of Crazed Demon Cave, Lady White Rabbit takes Profound Frost House from her immortal aperture with Rising Cloud City, Unbreakable Golden Fortress, Dragon Soul Dark Castle, Red River Pavilion, Red Heavenly Altar, and Scarlet Palace. Fang Yuan had gathered vast immortal materials there, ordered his time path clone He Chun Qiu to refine Immortal Gu with Four Elements Square Regret Blood Refinement Pool, then assembled Immortal Gu Houses to arm subordinates because he could not fight at full strength in that layer. The seven houses are modified on the basis of Cloud City, Dark Flow Giant City, Profound Ice House, Unbreakable Iron Fortress, Blood River Chariot, Nightmare Castle, Green Wave Pavilion, Weaving Cocoon Manor, Golden Altar, and other Immortal Gu Houses, treated as partial innovations rather than wholly new designs. Lady White Rabbit says Fang Yuan ordered them to charge with these houses as the vanguard; the seven then help save Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch and Xiao He Jian and sweep through two more sub-formations toward Book Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        2178
      ],
