    },
    {
      "text": "Bing Sai Chuan sees Profound Frost House, Dragon Soul Dark Castle, Red River Pavilion, and Red Heavenly Altar leave the mountain; Profound Frost House and Red River Pavilion then go to help Zhan Bu Du against Qing Chou. When Zhan Bu Du drives toward mid-mountain, Qing Chou chases but is obstructed by Profound Frost House and Red River Pavilion and cannot move quickly enough to stop him.",
      "chapters": [
        2181
